<tr><th>Code</th><th>What most people say</th><th>Actual</th></tr>
<tr><td>switch on boolean / long / float / double</td><td>valid</td><td>CE incompatible types</td></tr>
<tr><td>switch on Boolean / Long</td><td>wrappers are allowed from 1.5</td><td>CE — only Byte/Short/Character/Integer</td></tr>
<tr><td>switch(x);</td><td>valid empty, like if (true);</td><td>CE — { expected</td></tr>
